// RUN: %gopp lld --version | FileCheck %s
// RUN: %gopp version | FileCheck --check-prefix=VERSION %s
// RUN: not %gopp lld --no-such-flag 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=BAD %s
// P04.02, D4.9: the LLD bundled in gopp runs as `gopp lld ...`; its arguments
// are the linker's, so gopp does not read them as its own. A bad one is the
// linker's error and exit status.
// CHECK: LLD {{[0-9]+\.[0-9]+}}
// VERSION: LLD: LLD {{[0-9]+\.[0-9]+}}
// BAD: unknown argument '--no-such-flag'
